OL,3,GNEWSAStrike dispute resolved at four
OL,4,Aschools
OL,5,
OL,6,FTeaching unions have voted to end
OL,7,Fstrike action over workload and
OL,8,Fredundancies at four schools in
OL,9,FLincolnshire.
OL,11,FNational Education Union (NEU) members
OL,12,Fat schools in Horncastle, Boston and
OL,13,FHuttoft have taken seven days of strike
OL,14,Faction since May, and members of NASUWT
OL,15,Fhave also staged walkouts.
OL,23,APub: 17-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
