OL,3,GNEWSAStrike dispute resolved at four
OL,4,Aschools
OL,5,
OL,6,FBoth unions said their members had
OL,7,Fvoted for an agreement with Horncastle
OL,8,FEducation Trust, which included a
OL,9,Fcommitment to avoid compulsory
OL,10,Fredundancies, measures to reduce staff
OL,11,Fworkload and recognition of the trade
OL,12,Funions.
OL,14,FSandra James, chief executive of the
OL,15,Ftrust, welcomed the resolution and said
OL,16,Fit would continue working with unions
OL,17,Fand support pupils and staff.
